1
00:00:03,215 --> 00:00:04,990
Click Dial extension.

2
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:11,035
The country flag disappears, and the field reads Search a name, or enter an extension.

3
00:00:11,504 --> 00:00:15,190
Type an extension number, and the phone shows who it rings.

4
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:16,834
Or start typing a name:

5
00:00:16,834 --> 00:00:20,180
the people who match are listed with their extension.

6
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:21,824
Click one to call them.

7
00:00:22,334 --> 00:00:25,892
Click Dial phone number to go back to ordinary numbers.

8
00:00:25,892 --> 00:00:29,975
Extension calls are internal, so do-not-call lists do not apply.

9
00:00:29,975 --> 00:00:34,234
If your colleague does not answer, you are sent to their voicemail.

